        &lt;description&gt;Prerequisites : have to have a Prague VPN or be in the Prague office (instructions in the onboarding presentation)&amp;#13;
Connection to this mid server will be used for discovery.&amp;#13;
Connect to the server provided in the onboarding instructions via Remote desktop.&amp;#13;
Look up instructions from Servicenow on how to Manually install a MID Server on Windows and follow them.&amp;#13;
Manually install a MID server on the server you are connected to and connect to your private developer instance.&amp;#13;
&amp;#13;
Tips for actions to be done on the remote server: &amp;#13;
- create the MID server folder on C:/ and create a new folder named like : mid-firstnamesurname&amp;#13;
- make sure when changing the config to name the service with a unique name&amp;#13;
- when using start.bat run it as Administrator&amp;#13;
&amp;#13;
